{"id":"n2d3ad12ed5","headline":"Indian Rupee falls quickly back to Friday's record lows despite another RBI intervention","summary":"The rupee gave back gains from the Reserve Bank of India's latest intervention and returned to Friday's record lows against the US dollar. Bearish pressure on the currency persists.","why":"The rupee's exchange rate affects India's import costs, including oil, and the returns that foreign investors earn on Indian assets. The RBI manages volatility by intervening in the currency market.","category":"markets","event_type":"rates","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.076,"lon":72.878,"region":"asia"},"entities":[{"name":"Reserve Bank of India","ticker":null,"kind":"company","unresolved":"no-ticker"}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"investingLive","url":"https://investinglive.com:443/forex/indian-rupee-falls-quickly-back-to-fridays-record-lows-despite-another-rbi-intervention-20260330/"},"sources":[{"name":"investingLive","url":"https://investinglive.com:443/forex/indian-rupee-falls-quickly-back-to-fridays-record-lows-despite-another-rbi-intervention-20260330/"}],"published_at":"2026-03-30T08:13:14Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"9a63916331860a40","impacts":[],"why_moved":"The rupee reversed the gains from the RBI's intervention and slid back to record lows, as bearish pressure on the currency persisted.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-30T08:13:14Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-30T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"PK","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/banknotes-money-1362244.jpg","alt":"banknotes money (illustration)","credit":"NikolayFrolochkin","license":"Pixabay Content Licen